WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.830
Researcher Dan selected one airline ticket
to Hawaii, along with seven blank tickets,

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.030
for experimentation.

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:09.720
Before beginning the test, he made this note:

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:14.110
“This is not duplication for personal gain,
it's merely a work field trip for the broke”

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.910
He placed all of the tickets inside, turned
the machine to the setting "Very Fine," and

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.200
waited.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.150
This was the output produced:

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:24.740
Several small economy airline tickets for
Researcher Darby.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:29.480
When Researcher Dan attempted retrieval they
folded into paper airplane's reminiscent to

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.800
C-130's and attempted to escape containment.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:39.000
Four were captured by staff, two were shot
by onsite weapons, namely the H20-9000, and

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.449
one escaped retrieval by entering the air
vents and has presumably escaped.

